3776:reference/SLT-REF-09-paddle-vs-stripe-renewal-mechanics-creation-webhooks-no-ops-.md:40:### Local actions that are effectively no-ops for Paddle
3777:reference/SLT-REF-09-paddle-vs-stripe-renewal-mechanics-creation-webhooks-no-ops-.md:45:| `setupTrialPaymentMethod()` | returns success with existing meta; "Paddle handles trial periods natively" | `:645-657` |
