+
+- The immutable cursor was polled in calls no longer than 25 seconds; the exact customer match arrived naturally. No scheduler action, cron runner, or queue drain was invoked.
+- Paddle transaction `txn_01kzr5e5vvgb9wgt2pw2r74e7d` is `completed`, origin `subscription_recurring`, and belongs to the exact remote subscription.
